---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About ExamPath Lab — Editorial Philosophy & Standards"
  description="Why education platforms shouldn't look like coaching hoardings. Discover our editorial standards and original verification methodology."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'About' }]}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    
    <!-- Hero / Title -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <span class="field-badge text-[#147D78] border-[#147D78]/20 bg-[#E8F3F2]">Editorial Manifesto</span>
      <h1 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#172633] mt-2">
        Why Most Coaching Materials Fail Aspirants
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#536471] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        Most government exam websites in India look identical: loud banners, countdown timers, unverified 500-page PDF dumps, and exaggerated claims of guaranteed selection. We built ExamPath Lab to offer a modern, dignified alternative.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Learning Field Guide Concept -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1] shadow-sm mb-10 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-[#172633]">
        The Concept: A Modern Study Workspace
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#536471] leading-relaxed">
        ExamPath Lab is structured as a <strong class="text-[#172633]">Learning Field Guide</strong>. A field guide does not drown you in noise; it tells you what matters in the terrain ahead, what rules govern it, where the traps are hidden, and how to navigate efficiently.
      </p>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF8F3] border border-[#E2DDD1] text-xs space-y-2">
        <div class="font-bold text-[#147D78] uppercase tracking-wider">Our Core Methodological Cycle</div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-5 gap-2 text-center pt-2">
          <div class="p-2 rounded bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1] font-bold text-[#172633]">1. What to study</div>
          <div class="p-2 rounded bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1] font-bold text-[#172633]">2. How to understand</div>
          <div class="p-2 rounded bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1] font-bold text-[#172633]">3. How to remember</div>
          <div class="p-2 rounded bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1] font-bold text-[#172633]">4. How to solve</div>
          <div class="p-2 rounded bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1] font-bold text-[#172633]">5. How to revise</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Four Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1]">
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-[#147D78]">Cognitive Respect</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#536471] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          We treat students as serious professionals preparing for public service. We do not use casino-like gambling gamification, fake discount clocks, or pushy pop-ups.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1]">
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-[#147D78]">Mathematical Integrity</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#536471] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Shortcuts are explained with their mathematical boundaries. We teach standard methods first so your conceptual foundation never crumbles under unexpected exam variations.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1]">
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-[#147D78]">Bilingual By Design</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#536471] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          India prepares in both English and Hindi. Our interface and content are designed bilingually from the database layer up, not auto-translated as an afterthought.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1]">
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-[#147D78]">Lean Zero-Waste Operations</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#536471] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Built statically on Cloudflare Pages. By maintaining near-zero server infrastructure overhead, we keep high-quality preparation accessible without burning venture capital.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
